WEBVTT

00:00:06.303 --> 00:00:11.542
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Okinawa is an island about four hundred miles south of Japan.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:22.501
It is a beautiful island, with wonderful beaches and clear blue water.

00:00:28.259 --> 00:00:30.816
It also has more centenarians –

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:36.861
people who are a hundred years old or more – than anywhere else in the world.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:42.269
What’s more, they seem to age more slowly than other people.

00:00:43.149 --> 00:00:44.774
According to scientists,

00:00:45.294 --> 00:00:51.855
people there who are actually seventy often have the bodies of fifty-year-olds.

00:00:53.432 --> 00:00:57.760
Many of them are very healthy all through their lives.

00:00:58.106 --> 00:00:59.316
What’s their secret?

00:01:00.972 --> 00:01:05.593
Most people think it’s because of their healthy lifestyle.

00:01:06.841 --> 00:01:13.615
They don’t have big meals – they have a cultural habit called hara hachi bu,

00:01:14.075 --> 00:01:18.627
which means they always stop eating before they’re full.

00:01:20.553 --> 00:01:27.109
They usually just have fish and vegetables, especially sweet potatoes,

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:33.885
and they eat a lot of seaweed, which is one of the healthiest foods that there is.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:38.876
But diet isn’t the only reason why they live so long.

00:01:41.451 --> 00:01:44.292
The Okinawans are very active,

00:01:46.101 --> 00:01:50.655
and they often work in their gardens until they’re eighty or more.

00:01:52.923 --> 00:01:58.221
Many of them also do t'ai chi or martial arts, every day.

00:02:01.932 --> 00:02:03.798
They have a good social life.

00:02:05.233 --> 00:02:07.475
They visit friends or family,

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.176
and a lot of them belong to community centers.

00:02:14.577 --> 00:02:21.395
Some play the traditional Okinawan guitar, an instrument similar to a banjo.

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:33.109
The old people of Okinawa are very positive and happy with their lives.

00:02:33.669 --> 00:02:37.710
They aren’t stressed, because they’re never in a hurry.

00:02:39.371 --> 00:02:42.091
Their spiritual lives are important to them,

00:02:42.471 --> 00:02:47.383
especially the women, and many of them meditate every day.

00:02:48.289 --> 00:02:53.634
In Okinawa, people say you’re a child until you are fifty-five.

00:02:53.647 --> 00:02:55.785
And when you reach ninety-seven,

00:02:55.809 --> 00:03:00.504
your local town holds a special ceremony called kajimaya

00:03:00.528 --> 00:03:05.514
to celebrate the fact that now it’s time to be young again,

00:03:05.538 --> 00:03:11.407
to be free of all responsibilities and to simply enjoy life.